<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>06 / 学校端</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>防扭曲教学：五条不能越过的高压线</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'space-between', gap: 14 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #E8A33D', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>以下行为即使让某个指标变高，也不能被认定为优秀教学</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ width: 216, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>增加题量</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>靠堆量提升完成指标</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 216, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>反复刷同题</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>重复已会内容制造通过率</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 216, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>只练易得分内容</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>回避难点以美化数据</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 216, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>回避薄弱学生</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>选择性统计抬高均值</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 216, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>忽视实际负担</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>不控制学生任务时长</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>外部参考：MET 项目（CEPR Harvard）的多来源评价与复核方式可借鉴，但不能照搬指标</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：学校端设计思路.md §3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 62 / 124 </Text></Bo